---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Responsible gambling" description="Betting should stay entertainment. How to keep it under control, and where to get free, confidential help in Nigeria and across Africa.">
  <div class="stack" style="max-width:68ch">
    <div>
      <h1>Responsible gambling</h1>
      <p class="lede">Betting should stay entertainment. Predictions are estimates and losing runs happen, even on strong picks. You must be 18 or older to bet.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="stack" style="gap:10px">
      <h3>Keep it under control</h3>
      <ul class="prose-list">
        <li>Set a weekly limit before you bet, and stick to it.</li>
        <li>Never chase losses with bigger stakes.</li>
        <li>Don't bet with money meant for rent, school fees or food.</li>
        <li>Use your bookmaker's deposit limits, time-outs and self-exclusion tools.</li>
        <li>Remember that the more selections an accumulator has, the less likely it is to land. We show that chance on every slip.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="stack" style="gap:10px">
      <h3>Warning signs</h3>
      <ul class="prose-list">
        <li>Betting more than you planned, or more than you can afford to lose.</li>
        <li>Borrowing money, or selling things, to bet.</li>
        <li>Hiding your betting from family or friends.</li>
        <li>Feeling anxious or irritable when you aren't betting.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="stack" style="gap:10px">
      <h3>Get support</h3>
      <p style="margin:0">If betting is causing problems for you or someone close to you, free confidential help is available from <a href="https://www.gamblingtherapy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gambling Therapy</a>, which supports players in Nigeria and across Africa in several languages, and from <a href="https://www.begambleaware.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BeGambleAware</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
